9-copy","label":"School Rewards","price_text":"Under ₹79"}},"occasion_item_rVfUtT":{"type":"occasion_item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Ellipse_988.webp","url":"shopify:\/\/collections\/return-gifts-under-99-copy","label":"Birthday","price_text":"Under ₹199"}}},"block_order":["occasion_item_8BAkzJ","occasion_item_8dcNEk","occasion_item_BtAdMc","occasion_item_A93LKB","occasion_item_rVfUtT"],"name":"Perfect For Occasion","settings":{"badge_text":"QUICK ADD-ONS","heading_black":"PERFECT FOR EVERY","heading_red":"OCCASION","section_padding_top":0,"section_padding_bottom":0,"bg_color":"#ffffff"}},"faq_section_rEgtxc":{"type":"faq-section","blocks":{"faq_item_E3rJFB":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"What all do you have at Dawbu?","answer":"<p>At Dawbu, we offer a wide range of creative and educational building blocks and toys designed to inspire young minds. Our collection includes themed building sets featuring animals, space, dinosaurs, vehicles, and much more. Each product is carefully selected to encourage imaginative play, develop fine motor skills, and reduce screen time for children.<\/p><p>Whether you are looking for farm animals, military vehicles, construction sets, or colorful building blocks, we have something special for every child. All our toys are safe, affordable, and perfect for kids who love to build, create, and explore.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_GRWGNy":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"Is Dawbu genuine or fake?","answer":"<p>Dawbu is 100% genuine and trustworthy. We are a registered business based in Hyderabad, committed to providing high-quality, safe, and affordable toys for children. Our products are sourced from reliable suppliers and meet safety standards to ensure your child's well-being.<\/p><p>We value transparency and customer satisfaction. Thousands of happy parents across India trust Dawbu for their children's playtime needs. You can shop with complete confidence knowing that we stand behind every product we sell.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_CayNtE":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"Does Dawbu have a Cash on Delivery option?","answer":"<p>Yes, we offer Cash on Delivery for your convenience. You can pay for your order when it arrives at your doorstep, making shopping with Dawbu easy and hassle-free.<\/p><p>Please note that a small additional charge may apply for Cash on Delivery orders to cover processing costs. This helps us continue offering flexible payment options while maintaining our affordable pricing.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_frEDVN":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"Will all the toys work as shown?","answer":"<p>Absolutely. All our building blocks and toys are exactly as shown in the product images and descriptions. We ensure that every item is quality-checked before shipping to guarantee that it meets our standards and your expectations.<\/p><p>Our building sets come with all the pieces needed to create the designs shown. If you ever receive a product that does not match the description or has missing pieces, please contact us immediately, and we will resolve the issue promptly.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_QBNRWA":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"When will I receive my order? How can I track it?","answer":"<p>Most orders are delivered within 5 to 7 business days across India, depending on your location. We process and ship orders quickly to ensure your child can start playing as soon as possible.<\/p><p>Once your order is shipped, you will receive a tracking number via email or SMS. You can use this tracking number to monitor your order's journey in real-time. If you have any questions about your delivery, our customer support team is always here to help.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_eaLeac":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"Can you provide free toys?","answer":"<p>While we would love to give away free toys to everyone, we are a small business working hard to keep our prices affordable for all families. We occasionally run special promotions, discounts, and giveaways, so make sure to follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter to stay updated.<\/p><p>We believe every child deserves quality playtime, and we strive to offer the best value for your money with our competitively priced products.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_HWdDMG":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"How can I collaborate with Dawbu?","answer":"<p>We are always open to meaningful collaborations that align with our mission of promoting creative and educational play for children. Whether you are a content creator, educator, or organization working with children, we would love to hear from you.<\/p><p>Please reach out to us via email with details about your collaboration idea, and our team will get back to you as soon as possible. Together, we can make playtime more fun and enriching for kids everywhere.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_Xf8r8A":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"How can I supply toys or products to you?","answer":"<p>If you are a manufacturer or supplier of high-quality, safe, and creative toys or building blocks, we would be interested in learning more about your products. We are always looking to expand our catalog with items that meet our quality standards and align with our values.<\/p><p>Please send us an email with information about your products, including catalogs, certifications, pricing, and any other relevant details. Our procurement team will review your submission and reach out if there is a potential partnership opportunity.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["faq_item_E3rJFB","faq_item_GRWGNy","faq_item_CayNtE","faq_item_frEDVN","faq_item_QBNRWA","faq_item_eaLeac","faq_item_HWdDMG","faq_item_Xf8r8A"],"name":"FAQ — Got Answers","settings":{"badge_text":"GOT QUESTIONS?","heading_before":"WE'VE GOT","heading_highlight":"ANSWERS","heading_after":"","content_max_width":1200,"background_color":"#0d0d0d","card_color":"#1a1a1a","accent_color":"#faed17","highlight_color":"#cc0000","font_family":"Impact","padding_top":80,"padding_bottom":80}},"why_choo